The owner `Daniel` was refused with exit 1. The error names the field
`owner` and the rule `invalid_string`. The committed owner schema at
`packages/architecture-enforcement/src/contracts.ts:7` and `:81` accepts only
`/^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]*$/`. The default is the lower-case form of the same
owner: `daniel`. The rationale stayed unchanged.

